                                      <items count="7">
                                        <item name="Description" type_name="gh_string" type_code="10">Number of increments of the distribution of internal forces within each displacement design iteration. Since each increment entails updates of the system-stiffness this is computationally costly. The higher the number of increments within the design iterations the more statically determinate the resulting structure. </item>
